/* ============================================================================
 * Vehicle Diagnostics Platform - light theme (USER OVERRIDE)
 *
 * This file is an *override* slot, not the theme itself. It ships empty of
 * rules on purpose so an upgrade never clobbers your customisations.
 *
 * How the stylesheet is assembled at runtime:
 *
 *   1. ui/theme_manager.py generates the base QSS from the palette and the
 *      current DPI scale.
 *   2. ui/styles/custom_widgets.qss adds the rules for the custom widgets.
 *   3. THIS FILE is appended last, so anything you write here wins.
 *
 * Look it up with:
 *
 *     from src.core.configuration_manager import get_config
 *     get_config().theme_path("light")
 *
 * The palette of this theme, for reference:
 *
 *     background     #F8FAFC
 *     surface        #FFFFFF
 *     primary        #7C3AED
 *     text_primary   #1E293B
 *     border         #E2E8F0
 *
 * Uncomment and edit anything below to customise the light theme.
 * ==========================================================================*/

/* Make the accent colour orange instead of violet:
 *
 * QPushButton[accent="true"] {
 *     background-color: #F97316;
 *     border-color: #F97316;
 * }
 */

/* Enlarge the monospace payload fields:
 *
 * QLineEdit[role="mono"] {
 *     font-size: 15px;
 *     letter-spacing: 2px;
 * }
 */

/* Tighten the log table for very dense traces:
 *
 * QTableView#LogTable {
 *     font-size: 11px;
 * }
 */
